ass=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">quest.stellar.org/learn</span></p></div></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>🎮 ¿Qué aprenderemos en Stellar Quest Learn?</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">1️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Configurar tu billetera (Albedo)</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>-</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Creación de una billetera segura con Albedo.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Importancia de la clave secreta y la frase de recuperación.</span></p></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/bastiankoh/status/1890108091427090708\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">2️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Crear una cuenta en Stellar</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Generar claves públicas y privadas.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>-</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Financiar tu cuenta con Friendbot.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">3️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Realizar pagos (Payment)</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Construir y enviar transacciones en Stellar Laboratory.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">4️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Crear una Trustline (Change Trust)</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Permitir la recepción de activos específicos.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Gestionar ofertas en el DEX (Manage Offers)</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Crear y gestionar ofertas de compra y venta en el mercado descentralizado de Stellar.</span></p></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TellusCoop/status/1890717710805262714\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">6️⃣ </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Realizar Path Payments</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>- </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Enviar un activo y que el destinatario reciba otro automáticamente.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¡No te pierdas nuestros streams en Twitch, donde explicaremos paso a paso cada desafío y responderemos tus preguntas en vivo!</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">📺</span></p></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TellusCoop/status/1890053508428103870\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎁</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Y sí, ¡puedes ganar Swag exclusivo!</strong></span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://stellarchile.start.page/\" target=\"_blank\"><d